{'symbol': 'EVRG', 'date': '2023-02-24 07:00:00', 'title': 'EVERGY ANNOUNCES 2022 RESULTS, DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND AND ISSUES 2023 GUIDANCE', 'text': 'KANSAS CITY, MO.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EVERGY, INC. (NASDAQ: EVRG) TODAY ANNOUNCED FULL YEAR 2022 GAAP EARNINGS OF $753 MILLION, OR $3.27 PER SHARE, COMPARED TO GAAP EARNINGS OF $880 MILLION, OR $3.83 PER SHARE, FOR THE FULL YEAR 2021. FOURTH QUARTER 2022 GAAP EARNINGS WERE $7.5 MILLION, OR $0.03 PER SHARE, COMPARED TO EARNINGS OF $53.4 MILLION, OR $0.23 PER SHARE, FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2021.'}